cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CompileML in your research, please cite it as below."
title: CompileML
abstract: >-
  CompileML compiles tree-ensemble models into deterministic, auditable,
  integer-exact decision artifacts. A single hashed JSON document carries the
  integer-quantized score, isotonic calibration, fixed-point risk bands,
  reason codes, and exact per-feature attributions; a standard-library-only
  runtime scores it, and SQL and COBOL exporters reproduce the same integers
  row for row. At whitebox depth two or less, attribution is exact — every
  explanation sums back to the production score with no residual — and the
  artifact collapses to a classical points scorecard without approximation.
type: software
